# NOTE: this file is written and must be read via nitransforms
# (nitransforms.linear.load(path, fmt='fs').matrix), not FreeSurfer's own LTA
# tools -- nitransforms stores LTAs using FreeSurfer's "points convention",
# so the raw matrix numbers above are NOT the intended physical transform
# directly; only round-tripping through nitransforms' reader/writer gives
# back the correct matrix.
# Maps HiP-CT brain native physical space (mm, corner-origin: voxel (0,0,0) -> RAS
# (0,0,0), any pyramid level) to the BigBrain (2015 Release) scene RAS used by
# the siibra/EBRAINS viewer.
# CORRECTED 2026-09-01: this is the decoded Voluba/siibra JSON transform
# matrix (see BigBrain-EBB_registration_notes.md), applied DIRECTLY -- no
# axis permutation, no row reassignment. Earlier versions of this file
# applied a column swap (compensating for an assumed OME-Zarr (z,y,x) axis
# order) and an empirically-fit row reassignment (R=d0,A=d2,S=d1); both were
# dropped once the real OME-NGFF .zattrs confirmed the axes are actually
# (x,y,z), matching NIfTI's own (i,j,k) directly, making the permutation (and
# the row fit that was only compensating for it) unnecessary. Verified: the
# raw JSON 3x3 has det=+0.763 (no reflection), and applying this matrix to
# 494.08um_EBB.nii.gz's own native header, composed with
# BIGBRAIN_MICROSCOPIC_TEMPLATE_HISTOLOGY.nii.gz's own real ras2vox, visually
# matches the template in freeview (confirmed by the user) -- see
# BigBrain-EBB_registration_notes.md for the full resolution writeup.
